* Provisional semiconductor models for the Big Muff Pi V3 reference circuit.
* Topology and passive values come from the archived ElectroSmash schematic.
* Semiconductor parameters must later be replaced by measured or sourced
* BC239 and 1N914 models. Do not treat these parameters as final truth.

.model D1N914 D(
+ IS=2.52n
+ N=1.752
+ RS=0.568
+ CJO=4p
+ M=0.4
+ VJ=0.75
+ TT=20n
+ BV=100
+ IBV=0.1u )

.model BC239 NPN(
+ IS=1e-14
+ BF=400
+ NF=1.0
+ VAF=100
+ IKF=0.1
+ ISE=1e-13
+ NE=1.5
+ BR=5
+ NR=1.0
+ VAR=20
+ IKR=0.02
+ ISC=1e-13
+ NC=2.0
+ RB=100
+ RE=0.5
+ RC=1
+ CJE=12p
+ VJE=0.65
+ MJE=0.33
+ CJC=4p
+ VJC=0.5
+ MJC=0.33
+ TF=0.5n
+ TR=50n )
